<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - American General started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - American General started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer and Co said it started coverage of American General Corp with market perform.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 1/4 at 38-1/4.</p>
</text>
